:: Millers Babysitting Intro First Time [nobr]

/* Intro */
Getting past the guard that protects Avendale from <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Riff-raff like you”</span>, as he put it, wasn’t as easy as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> said it would be. You flashed him the visitor’s pass <span style="color:Yellow">just to be accused for creating a fake or stealing it.</span> You were almost refused entry until you convinced him to call the Miller house to confirm. Though the smug look you were able to give him as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Hakeem</span> told him to let you pass was worth it. It is moments like that give you the energy to go on. Which is good, because the Miller’s driveway was so long you nearly didn’t think you were going to make it! <br>
<br>
You walk up the wide, stretched gray brick driveway, admiring the flanking finely groomed hedged and perfectly symmetrical trees that both guide and welcome you inward. The rich really do live differently! At least their house was missing the strangely shaped hedges or over-the-top decorations that seemed to fill the yards of every other house. Though the house is still splendid, with large towering walls full of nearly floor to ceiling windows in some cases! Where you can see walls are made of a white stone, small plates of caramel-colored wood, and other spots of light gray. You’re pretty sure your family could never afford this house, no matter how many Odd Jobs you do! <br>
<br>
Walking up the perfect wood stairs, you stand in front of their large front door, feeling almost smaller by it’s sheer scale. The wood looks hard and you can already feel your knuckles throbbing when you notice the doorknob. You press it and a fun musical chime plays, echoing throughout the large house. You pause, before you hear rustling. A small red light on the door bell comes on and you suddenly get the feeling you are being watched. The front of the house has at least two or three security cameras that rotate towards you, probably needed considering <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Hakeem</span>’s fame. You wave awkwardly at one. 

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Zay",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

A minute later you hear the sound of the door unlocking and a deadbolt being moved, quite the security they have here, before the door swings open <span style="color:LightGreen">and you see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> standing there smiling.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Good timing man!”</span> He gives you a friendly smile as greeting, patting you on the shoulder. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We were just about to head out, weren’t sure you were going to come. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> will be stooked he gets to stay home. Come on in.”</span> He leads you inside, walking you through the large marble-floored hallway directly into a large, fancy living room. <br>
<br>
The living room has a pair of expensive looking leather couches, a massive television, and floor to ceiling windows that showcase their equally impressive backyard. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> lies on one of the couches upside down, frowning, <span style="color:LightGreen">before he sees you and instantly perks up.</span>

